  "description": "Maternity Fashion Figure | 16 Poses\nCreate professional maternity fashion sketches with this collection of 16 maternity fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features realistic pregnant female fashion figures with natural body proportions and clearly defined baby bump silhouettes.\nThe Maternity Collection is perfect for maternity wear design, pregnancy fashion collections, nursing apparel concepts, womenswear development, fashion illustration, portfolio projects, and client presentations.\nThese poses help designers accurately visualize maternity garments while maintaining professional fashion proportions and realistic body balance.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 16 Maternity Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Fashion Figure Bases\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Maternity Wear Brands\n• Apparel Brands\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Maternity Wear Design\n• Pregnancy Fashion Collections\n• Nursing Apparel Design\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Portfolio Development\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 16 Maternity Fashion Figure Poses\n• Realistic Pregnancy Silhouettes\n• Professional Fashion Proportions\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
